flowchart TB
    subgraph ACP[ACP: internal agent coordination]
      Planner[Planner Agent] --> Supervisor[Supervisor]
      Supervisor --> ResumeAgent[Resume Agent]
      Supervisor --> SearchAgent[Job Discovery Agent]
      Supervisor --> ApplyAgent[Application Agent]
      ResumeAgent --> State[(Durable Workflow State)]
      SearchAgent --> State
      ApplyAgent --> State
