    subgraph MCP[MCP: external capabilities]
      Tools[Tool Registry] --> JobSearch[Job Search Tools]
      Tools --> Files[Storage / File Tools]
      Tools --> Gmail[Email / Calendar Tools]
      Tools --> ATS[ATS / Browser Tools]
    end

    ResumeAgent --> Tools
    SearchAgent --> Tools
    ApplyAgent --> Tools
